  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced. Cut sweet potato into wedges. Place on a lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil, season with salt and toss to coat. Bake until tender, 20-25 minutes.\n• In a medium bowl, add haloumi and cover with water. TIP: If your oven tray is crowded, divide the wedges between two trays.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/63f31f612e35d7c34a0efe6f/step-2cf1254a.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, grate carrot. Halve snacking tomatoes (see ingredients).\n• Place chicken breast between two sheets of baking paper. Pound with a meat mallet or rolling pin until even in thickness, about 1cm-thick.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/63f31f612e35d7c34a0efe6f/step-48dd61f1.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Drain haloumi and pat dry. Cut haloumi into 1cm-thick slices.\n• In a shallow bowl, combine plain flour, the salt and a good pinch of pepper. In a second shallow bowl, whisk egg. In a third shallow bowl, combine panko breadcrumbs, lemon pepper seasoning (see ingredients) and a pinch of salt and pepper.\n• Dip the haloumi slices into the flour mixture, followed by egg, and finally in the panko breadcrumbs. Set aside on a plate.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/63f31f612e35d7c34a0efe6f/step-688cae30.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "In a large frying pan, heat enough olive oil to cover the base over medium-high heat. When oil is hot, cook haloumi until golden brown, 2 minutes each side. Set aside on a paper towel-lined plate.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/63f31f612e35d7c34a0efe6f/step-15712276.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While haloumi is cooking, combine Dijon mustard (see ingredients), vinegar and some olive oil (1 tbs for 2 people / 2 tbs for 4 people) in a large bowl.\n• Season, then add salad leaves, carrot and tomatoes. Toss to coat. Little cooks: Take the lead by tossing the salad!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/63f31f612e35d7c34a0efe6f/step-7d3ca2a9.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide lemony crumbed haloumi, salad and sweet potato wedges between plates. Crumble fetta cubes over salad.\n• Serve with creamy pesto dressing. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/63f31f612e35d7c34a0efe6f/step-cae9546c.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
